  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Latin Parish Of Taybeh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Irish Representative Office in Ramallah, through the HoMs Fund, will support the Latin Church aiming to establish a specialized ceramics workshop that produces unique pieces inspired by the cultural and religious heritage of the Holy Land and the Holy Land. These emerging designs are inspired by Christian heritage, adding significant cultural and religious value to each handcrafted piece. These creations respect the rich history and connect the past and present by incorporating symbols of the great Christian city into their designs, contributing to the preservation of local heritage and its global dissemination, the relaunch of this project will provide 10 jobs to empower women.</narrative>
  </description>
